The  utility is supposed to provide most locale specific informa‐
tion to the standard output.  When is invoked  without  arguments
it will print out a summary of the current locale environment de‐
pending  on  environment  variable  settings and internal status.
When is invoked with arguments and no options specified  it  will
print  out  value  determined using current locale settings.  The
following options are available: Write names of all available lo‐
cales.  While looking for locales will  respect  the  environment
variable,  and use it instead of the system default locale direc‐
tory.  Write the category name for the selected keywords.   Write
the  name and value of the selected keywords.  Write names of all
available charmaps.  Special / keyword can be used to retrieve  a
human readable list of available keywords.  conforms to first ap‐
